  lines:
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 752313563, guid: 300db373928b38f45a1826963cc9dcc3, type: 3}
    name: Kairos
    text: Ugh...
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 1047115457, guid: 37d55987ad413b240ab05e7a56eec345, type: 3}
    name: Lucius
    text: ~~~~~ ~~~~~~~ ~~~~~! ~~~ ~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~~~~~?
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 752313563, guid: 300db373928b38f45a1826963cc9dcc3, type: 3}
    name: Kairos
    text: (Oh no... Now I can't even hear his voice...)
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 1047115457, guid: 37d55987ad413b240ab05e7a56eec345, type: 3}
    name: Lucius
    text: ~~~~ ~~~~~ ~~~ ~ ~~~~. ~~ ~~~~~~~~~~ ~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~~~~.
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 752313563, guid: 300db373928b38f45a1826963cc9dcc3, type: 3}
    name: Kairos
    text: (He must be confused that I'm not answering him...)
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 752313563, guid: 300db373928b38f45a1826963cc9dcc3, type: 3}
    name: Kairos
    text: Let's try the other way, Lucius.
